  "notable_quotes": [
    "A probable formation mechanism assigns azide generation in the product to the fraction of C-N and N-N bonds in the atz ligand.",
    "Prior EMOF strategies often require elaborate ligand design or days-long low-yield syntheses, limiting efficient preparation of N-rich, thermostable materials.",
    "[Zn2(atz)3(N3)]n was synthesized in one step from commercial 5-amino-1H-tetrazole under mild, relatively low-temperature conditions with ~90% yield."
